WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:14.551
the funeral Tom was treated like a hero, and he loved it.

2
00:00:15.511 --> 00:00:17.552
At school he knew everyone was watching him.

3
00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:22.135
The schoolchildren thought Joe and Tom were the greatest heroes in Petersburg, Missouri.

4
00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:26.117
Some even thought they were the greatest heroes in the whole state of Missouri.

5
00:00:27.698 --> 00:00:31.880
Tom had decided that he should be free of Becky because being a hero was better than love.

6
00:00:32.712 --> 00:00:34.573
His eyes, however, often betrayed him.

7
00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:38.474
He pretended not to see her, but his eyes followed her everywhere.

8
00:00:39.154 --> 00:00:43.195
Becky also decided to be free of Tom, but her eyes also betrayed her.

9
00:00:43.895 --> 00:00:48.316
When Becky saw Tom talking to Amy Lawrence, she felt a sharp pang in her heart.

10
00:00:50.877 --> 00:00:55.398
One day she tried to walk away but her feet wouldn't obey, and she found herself standing next

11
00:00:55.418 --> 00:00:55.858
to Tom.

12
00:00:56.719 --> 00:01:01.620
She looked at Mary Austin and said, "Mary, why didn't you come to Sunday school yesterday?"

13
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.161
"I did come.

14
00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:04.502
Didn't you see me?"

15
00:01:04.862 --> 00:01:05.523
she replied.

16
00:01:05.543 --> 00:01:08.005
"Why no," lied Becky.

17
00:01:08.025 --> 00:01:09.286
"Where did you sit?"

18
00:01:10.327 --> 00:01:13.049
"I sat where I always sit," answered Mary.

19
00:01:13.069 --> 00:01:14.150
"I saw you."

20
00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.712
"You did?"

21
00:01:16.112 --> 00:01:16.693
said Becky.

22
00:01:16.713 --> 00:01:19.655
"Anyway, I wanted to tell you about the picnic."

23
00:01:19.675 --> 00:01:21.097
"What picnic?"

24
00:01:21.537 --> 00:01:22.137
asked Mary.

25
00:01:22.157 --> 00:01:25.661
"The one my ma's going to let me have," answered Becky.

26
00:01:25.681 --> 00:01:27.943
"She said I can invite anyone.

27
00:01:28.523 --> 00:01:29.304
Do you want to come?"

28
00:01:30.228 --> 00:01:32.749
Mary thought it was a great idea, so she agreed.

29
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:38.012
Other boys and girls were soon asking to come, and Becky said yes to each one.

30
00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:41.693
The only ones who didn't ask were Tom and Amy.

31
00:01:43.174 --> 00:01:47.596
At lunch Becky waited just outside the schoolhouse in case Tom wanted to say something then.

32
00:01:48.337 --> 00:01:51.698
But to Becky's surprise, Tom didn't ask about the picnic at all.

33
00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:55.200
This made Becky very upset.

34
00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.905
She was planning her revenge on Tom when she saw Alfred Temple spilling ink on Tom's spelling book.

35
00:02:01.585 --> 00:02:04.608
Becky was about to tell Tom, but then she changed her mind.

36
00:02:05.309 --> 00:02:08.592
If she didn't tell on Alfred, then Tom would be punished for the spilled ink!

37
00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:11.814
That would serve Tom right for his treatment of Becky!

38
00:02:13.176 --> 00:02:16.378
As Becky went back into the schoolhouse, she noticed that Mr.

39
00:02:16.418 --> 00:02:18.460
Dobbins had left a key on his desk.

40
00:02:19.301 --> 00:02:22.284
Mr. Dobbins was a schoolteacher who dreamed of being a doctor.

41
00:02:23.308 --> 00:02:25.869
When the students were busy reading or studying, Mr.

42
00:02:25.889 --> 00:02:28.711
Dobbins would open his locked desk and remove a book.

43
00:02:30.031 --> 00:02:34.653
Every child had a theory about what the book contained, but no one had actually seen its contents.

44
00:02:35.474 --> 00:02:38.976
Becky realized that this was her chance to read from the secret book!

45
00:02:40.016 --> 00:02:42.577
Swiftly, she unlocked the drawer and reached for the book.

46
00:02:44.398 --> 00:02:48.040
The title had something to do with anatomy, but that meant nothing to Becky.

47
00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:54.285
So she began to flip through the book, and saw two colorful figures: a man and a woman.

48
00:02:55.025 --> 00:02:58.088
She was startled to find that both figures were completely naked.

49
00:02:58.809 --> 00:03:01.791
Just then a long shadow fell across the teacher's desk.

50
00:03:02.772 --> 00:03:03.933
Somebody was at the door!

51
00:03:06.075 --> 00:03:09.638
In her haste to close the book and put it away, Becky tore a page.

52
00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.822
She turned to see who was there—it was Tom!

53
00:03:14.763 --> 00:03:16.988
She shouted at him, "Oh!

54
00:03:17.008 --> 00:03:19.249
You're so mean sneaking up on me like that."

55
00:03:19.269 --> 00:03:23.192
"I didn't know you were looking at something," replied Tom.

56
00:03:23.212 --> 00:03:27.454
"Still, it's your fault I ripped a page.

57
00:03:28.134 --> 00:03:31.216
Now you're going to tell on me, and I'm going to be whipped.

58
00:03:32.057 --> 00:03:35.358
I've never been whipped at school before," she cried.

59
00:03:36.579 --> 00:03:41.842
Tom wanted to say that he wouldn't tell, but Becky continued, "Be mean if you want, but you're

60
00:03:41.882 --> 00:03:44.904
going to be punished too, for spilled ink on your book."

61
00:03:46.152 --> 00:03:48.253
Tom could see that Becky was really afraid.

62
00:03:50.134 --> 00:03:52.795
When the teacher returned, Tom looked over at Becky.

63
00:03:53.675 --> 00:03:56.076
Her face was still full of fear and guilt.

64
00:03:56.096 --> 00:04:00.698
"Girls just can't lie like boys can," thought Tom.

65
00:04:01.799 --> 00:04:03.820
The first lesson after lunch was spelling.

66
00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.501
Tom got whipped for the ink that had been spilled in his spelling book.

67
00:04:09.062 --> 00:04:13.084
Tom couldn't remember if he had or hadn't spilled the ink, and he protested loudly.

68
00:04:14.212 --> 00:04:16.914
After the spelling lesson, the teacher told them to read.

69
00:04:18.235 --> 00:04:19.836
Mr. Dobbins took out his own book.

70
00:04:21.537 --> 00:04:25.720
When he opened it, he noticed the tear and shouted, "Who ripped this page?"

71
00:04:26.701 --> 00:04:28.522
The students answered him with silence.

72
00:04:29.483 --> 00:04:29.923
So Mr.

73
00:04:29.963 --> 00:04:32.385
Dobbins began asking each student in turn.

74
00:04:33.786 --> 00:04:36.708
Tom noticed that Becky was becoming more and more anxious.

75
00:04:36.728 --> 00:04:40.110
"She's going to confess," thought Tom.

76
00:04:41.191 --> 00:04:45.590
At last the teacher said, "Becky Thatcher, did you tear this page?"

77
00:04:48.852 --> 00:04:50.654
"I did it," blurted out Tom.

78
00:04:51.835 --> 00:04:53.336
Every student was horrified.

79
00:04:54.016 --> 00:04:56.058
Tom Sawyer never admitted to anything.

80
00:04:56.878 --> 00:04:57.819
Tom took his whipping.

81
00:04:58.339 --> 00:05:01.021
When he got back to his seat, there was a note from Becky.

82
00:05:02.022 --> 00:05:04.024
"You're so noble," it read.
